        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "Ecuador and Colombia: the Galápagos, the Andes and the Caribbean in 12 days"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:lead:e3456bc1f4d270f4",
      "field": "lead",
      "sourceTextSha256": "3cee8e9bfcf9acb4ff01a6aaa0bb5c8601ccf64a2509362fd4320ec810fa68cb",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-d1461c91bf6a",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "This trip from 11 to 22 November 2026 combines Ecuador and Colombia. In Quito, visit the historic centre and the equator. In the Galápagos, see giant tortoises and take a boat excursion. The route then continues through Medellín and Guatapé to Cartagena, Bogotá and the Salt Cathedral of Zipaquirá. Accommodation in 4-star hotels and domestic flights are included."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:priceNote:9b6b7f5cf7b1e557",
      "field": "priceNote",
      "sourceTextSha256": "737ba33f8a0b0215336a86d531fb75a01d85bfbea396646e79c82a66d31df3cd",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-d1461c91bf6a",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "Per person: $5,390 based on sharing a double room (½ DBL) or $6,040 in a single room (SGL). Four-star hotels and domestic flights are included. The final price is confirmed when all services and flights are booked."
    },
